 "content": "Invoice PDFs are rendered by `render_pdf()` in src/billing/pdf.py using WeasyPrint (the \"v2\" renderer, gated by the `invoice-pdf-v2` flag in flags.toml, currently on). The old wkhtmltopdf/pdfkit renderer was removed; render_pdf raises if the flag is off. The font is configured in code: the module-level `_STYLE` CSS string declares `@font-face { font-family: Inter; src: url(assets/Inter.woff2) }` and applies it to body. Change the font there. Caveat: the url is relative and HTML(string=...) is called without base_url, and no assets/Inter.woff2 exists in the repo, so WeasyPrint may silently fall back to a system font.",
